OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FIt will stay
OL,6,Fdry with evening sunshine followed by
OL,7,Fclear periods overnight. However, the
OL,8,Fodd patch of low cloud could reform by
OL,9,Fthe morning in the far west. A warm
OL,10,Fnight with light winds.
OL,11,
OL,12,CWednesday:FEarly low cloud will soon
OL,13,Fclear to leave another dry and settled
OL,14,Fday across the region with a good deal
OL,15,Fof sunshine. Turning hot in the
OL,16,Fafternoon, with light winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
