OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:FNot
OL,6,Fas hot on Thursday with sunny spells
OL,7,Fand perhaps a few showers. Largely dry
OL,8,Fon Friday and Saturday with plenty of
OL,9,Fsunshine and fairly gentle winds.
OL,10,FStill feeling warm.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
